left.raw_text:
Inclusion Criteria:
  -  Meeting the diagnostic criteria of CTTH in the international classification of headache disorders, 3rd edition (beta version) (ICHD-III beta);
  -  Aged 18-55 years;
  -  Having the ability of understanding  [AND] and completing the headache dairy;
  -  Provide written informed consent

right.raw_text:
Exclusion Criteria:
  -  No headache during the pervious 3 months;
  -  Taking any prophylactic medication during the previous one month;
  -  Secondary headache  [OR] or any systematic cause
  -  Having serious conditions of the heart, [OR]  liver, [OR]  kidney  [OR] or other organs;
  -  In pregnancy  [OR] or lactation, [OR]  or planning to be pregnant in 6 months;
  -  Drug  [OR] and Substance abuse
  -  Diagnosed psychiatric condition
  -  Taking any other complementary  [OR] and alternative medicines
  -  Practicing yoga of any kind in last three months
